From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:24:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] podman: lock the storage's home mount for its lazy feature
 probes

podman's storage probes some kernel features only when it is first
asked about them, mounting under its home without the lock that keeps
another process from binding the home onto itself meanwhile. podman
commands starting together on a run root without the probes' records,
as the first ones after a boot, then leave the probes' mounts behind now
and then: they stay until a reboot and keep the file system under the
storage busy.

Carry the storage patch that locks the home's mount for these probes. It
is meant for go.podman.io/storage, which podman vendors.

Signed-off-by: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 utils/podman/Makefile                         |   2 +-
 ...-s-mount-for-the-lazy-feature-probes.patch | 138 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 139 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 utils/podman/patches/021-overlay-lock-home-s-mount-for-the-lazy-feature-probes.patch

diff --git a/utils/podman/Makefile b/utils/podman/Makefile
